398 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 100 0 R/T(Second, the 1% target was replaced by a 1.5% target in 2023 without acknowledging that it had been raised, and the deadline pushed back to 2030/31. When the Mayor's term ends in 2028, the latest figure will be 2027 which, even if it's far above the target, allows plenty of scope to argue that things are still on track.)/E(Second, the 1% target was replaced by a 1.5% target in 2023 without acknowledging that it had been raised, and the deadline pushed back to 2030/31. When the Mayor's term ends in 2028, the latest figure will be 2027 which, even if it's far above the target, allows plenty of scope to argue that things are still on track.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

