755 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 107 0 R/T(The 2008/09 figures are bus and Tube only; adding the Overground, DLR and Tramlink would raise them, while the modern totals cover all modes. On a twenty-year view, today's "record enforcement" is barely half the 2008/09 level of prosecutions and about 28% below its level of penalty fares, on a network carrying more passengers.)/E(The 2008/09 figures are bus and Tube only; adding the Overground, DLR and Tramlink would raise them, while the modern totals cover all modes. On a twenty-year view, today's "record enforcement" is barely half the 2008/09 level of prosecutions and about 28% below its level of penalty fares, on a network carrying more passengers.)/Pg 28 0 R/K[4]>>
