endobj

990 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 113 0 R/T(The throughput is the problem. The published outputs of the intelligence-led approach are: 65 individuals investigated in spring 2022; 421 investigated in 2023 \(over 50,000 journeys, \243300k of fares\); 414 identified in 2024 \(\243363k\); and 360 prolific evaders prosecuted with \243400k+ awarded in the year to April 2025. Set against an estimated \243190m annual loss, the prolific-offender programme touches well under 1% of the problem by value, and TfL publishes no analysis of what share of)/E(The throughput is the problem. The published outputs of the intelligence-led approach are: 65 individuals investigated in spring 2022; 421 investigated in 2023 \(over 50,000 journeys, \243300k of fares\); 414 identified in 2024 \(\243363k\); and 360 prolific evaders prosecuted with \243400k+ awarded in the year to April 2025. Set against an estimated \243190m annual loss, the prolific-offender programme touches well under 1% of the problem by value, and TfL publishes no analysis of what share of)/Pg 34 0 R/K[4]>>
