1991 0 obj
<</Title(On 15th June 2026, Mayor Khan launched a \2437 million plan to tackle the "dark blizzard of disinformation" which he claimed is giving people a false impression of London. An accusation that looks like a confession.)/Dest[12 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1127 0 R/Next 2074 0 R>>
endobj

1992 0 obj
<</Title(press release, giving Londoners a false picture that things had improved when they had not. It's hard to believe this was by accident as TfL holds all this information.)/Dest[12 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1127 0 R/Prev 2075 0 R>>
endobj

1993 0 obj
<</Title(Perhaps the most important finding is that on numerous occasions in the past, fare evasion has been successfully reduced. When TfL took over the Overground, they reduced its evasion from 12.6% to 1.8% in four years.)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 1127 0 R/Next 2076 0 R>>
endobj

