<</Title(So this is a report in two halves. The first half consists of this foreword and section 1 which set out the overall problem then seek to tackle it at source with a plan for Transport for London to publish information routinely in a consistent, comparable fashion, including rates of evasion, action being taken, rate by mode, and performance against their own targets. This is all information that TfL has published in the past.)/Dest[14 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 2390 0 R/Next 2394 0 R>>
endobj

