2409 0 obj
<</Title(Close the loop on enforcement that does not deter. Publish each year the penalty fare collection rate by mode, as TfL did in 2003, when non-payment ran at 15\20530 per cent against more than 50 per cent today, and what happens to unpaid fares. If the stated policy of prosecuting non-payment is not being applied at scale, say so and explain why. A \243100 fine that most recipients never pay should not be reported as a deterrent without that context.)/Dest[16 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2403 0 R/Prev 2419 0 R>>
