<</Title(TfL's estimate of revenue lost has risen from "more than \243130m" a year \(April 2025\) to "circa \243190m" \(June 2026\). Its own FOI dates the \243190m back to 2023/24, while press releases were still citing \243130m. The long-run series shows the cash loss was broadly stable for two decades before almost trebling after the pandemic: about \24350m \(2003\), \24370m \(2008/09\), \24363m \(2011\), \24355.7m net/\24386.1m gross \(2016\).)/Dest[18 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 2410 0 R/Next 2432 0 R>>
endobj

