<</Title(Enforcement peaked long before the pandemic. In 2008/09 TfL successfully prosecuted 26,002 people \(21,225 bus; 4,777 Tube\) and issued 95,980 penalty fares \(75,193 bus; 20,787 Tube\) \204 just bus and Tube. Today's "record" 14,406 convictions \(2025/26, all modes\) is barely half the 2008/09 figure. Even the 29,113 prosecutions in 2019/20 points to falling enforcement on a twenty-year view because that covers the whole network.)/Dest[17 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2421 0 R/Prev 2443 0 R/Next 2431 0 R>>
