<</Title(Setting numeric targets and publishing them used to be TfL's normal practice. The 2007/08 business plan published a network average bus fare evasion target of below 3.2% \(and a 95% prosecution success target\); the 2009/10 Budget published bus irregularity targets of 1.4% and 8.3%; the Overground concession carries a contractual 2% ticketless travel target and the DLR franchise a 3% compensation trigger. The current refusal to publish mode-level targets is a departure from TfL's own history.)/Dest[17 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2421 0 R/Prev 2449 0 R/Next 2437 0 R>>
