<</Title(The June 2026 release presents 2025/26 as "a nine per cent increase" in penalty fares and an "18.7 per cent increase" in Irregularity Reports. Both comparisons are against 2024/25, a year in which both measures fell. Against 2023/24, penalty fares are up about 6% over two years and Irregularity Reports are roughly level.)/Dest[28 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2654 0 R/Next 2696 0 R>>
