<</Title(Fifth, internal targets exist but are not published. TfL's strategy summary describes the approach as "target driven", with "clearly defined targets\203 across each of our modes". None of this seems to have been published, except one which emerged via FOI: an internal Underground target of 4.1% for 2024/25, which was missed with an outturn of 4.8%. Section 3.1 shows this secrecy is new, as mode- level targets used to appear in TfL's published budgets.)/Dest[21 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 2690 0 R/First 2742 0 R/Last 2742 0 R/Count -1/Next 2743 0 R>>
