2725 0 obj
<</Title(Against this, the London Assembly Transport Committee was told that before 2022/23 TfL "did not consistently track or measure levels of fare evasion". The record shows a consistent, published, multi-modal measurement regime with named survey months, sample sizes and methodology, running from the mid-2000s until at least 2019/20 \(the January 2020 FOI reports survey results to December 2019\). The gap is 2020\2052022; the silence about 2017\2052019 remains unexplained \204 years for which an update was requested, promised in writing, and never delivered.)/Dest[26 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2691 0 R/Prev 2748 0 R/First 2749 0 R/Last 2750 0 R/Count -2>>
endobj

