2848 0 obj
<</Title(the series. The Mayor's answer of 6 May 2020 stated it was revising its methodology "to provide a more accurate, consistent and comparable measure of revenue loss across the different networks", and would provide the data "once the methodology is finalised". The methodology was finalised \204 it has been in use since 2022/23 \204 but the promised data was never provided. And note that the new methodology was billed as providing comparability. TfL's present position is that the change to the method makes comparison impossible, which is the opposite of what was promised in 2020.)/Dest[25 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2804 0 R/Prev 2893 0 R>>
endobj

