2881 0 obj
<</Title(The composition matters. The improvement in the headline rate since 2022/23 is driven almost entirely by the Underground's fall from its post-pandemic spike \(6.7% to around 5%\) and the Elizabeth line. Bus evasion has risen steadily \(1.9% to 2.6%\), tram evasion remains around 7\2058%, and Underground evasion rose again in 2025/26 to 5.0%. That's one unpaid journey in twenty.)/Dest[23 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2841 0 R>>
endobj

